00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.180
- I've gone to the point

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:10.190
where I will go through an entire day

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:14.210
of just having the little
bit of garnish on my food

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:16.490
and count that as my
vegetable for the day.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.330
- Well, I've been Vegan for a year.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.090
Some of you might think, oh
so she must be really healthy

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.950
and eat a lot of vegetables, but I don't.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.080
- I've been feeling
really lethargic lately.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.070
I'm hoping that eating
enough fresh vegetables

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:28.160
might change that.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.940
- For women, 19 to 30, should
have one and a half cups

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.490
