00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:36.091
- Five point five cups of
red and orange vegetables.

00:00:36.091 --> 00:00:39.018
- And five cups of starch vegetables.

00:00:39.018 --> 00:00:40.270
- I could do that.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:41.103
Although, hang on.

00:00:41.103 --> 00:00:41.936
How much is a cup?

00:00:41.936 --> 00:00:42.769
I'm not for sure.

00:00:42.769 --> 00:00:44.530
That seems like quite a lot
now I'm thinking about it.

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:48.390
- I have to eat two cups
of dark green vegetables,

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:51.156
six cups of red-green vegetables,

00:00:51.156 --> 00:00:54.530
six cups of starch vegetables.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:56.593
I feel like I'm just gonna
poop a lot this week.

00:00:56.593 --> 00:00:57.426
