00:00:57.426 --> 00:00:59.600
'cause I don't know what
to do with any of them.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:02.277
- I'm realizing I don't really
know how much is a serving

00:01:02.277 --> 00:01:03.790
of certain foods.

00:01:12.153 --> 00:01:13.250
- Yay cheese.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:15.994
- [Ray] So today for
lunch, I had this pizza,

00:01:15.994 --> 00:01:20.994
