side salad, but today I did.

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:24.790
- I took out my Vegan
Cookbook for Beginners

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:28.510
and there's no whole category
for cooking vegetables.

00:01:28.510 --> 00:01:30.730
They're like, bitch
you should know by now.

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:33.520
- So, I'm at brunch and
originally I was gonna get

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:35.260
The Hangover Killer Scramble,

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:37.330
