00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.210
I'm getting the Angeleno
Veggie two point O.

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:42.110
It actually looks really good.

00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:44.190
I'm pretty sure this cuts
for like two servings

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:45.023
at the least.

00:01:45.023 --> 00:01:48.650
