00:02:35.671 --> 00:02:37.770
'cause I can never have too many of them.

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:40.060
I gotta get through this now

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:42.850
so I can forget about
for the rest of the day

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:44.320
which is not how you're suppose to do it.

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:47.710
- My veges look sort of wilted?

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:50.860
I couldn't do you guys.

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:52.170
I couldn't finish them.

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:54.000
Oh my god, they're so dry.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.420
- So I'm pretty impressed with myself

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:57.810
