00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:12.040
- There's gonna be a lot of farts.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.820
- I ate more than enough yesterday.

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:15.408
- Oh.
- Oh.

00:03:15.408 --> 00:03:16.241
